WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.370
Eight notes sit in a row.

2
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:04.750
The model does not hear music.

3
00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:08.770
It only counts which pitch followed which.

4
00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:14.040
Today: attention, the transformer, and why

5
00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:16.640
eight notes are a count and not a song.

6
00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:19.510
Attention scores every

7
00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:21.750
earlier item and mixes them.

8
00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:24.920
The new vector is a weighted sum.

9
00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:27.850
A transformer block adds that

10
00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:29.430
mix back onto the original.

11
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:31.600
Nothing is forced through

12
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:32.820
one narrow state.

13
00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:36.160
The melody lab always picks

14
00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:37.760
the most common follower.

15
00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:40.370
A pitch it never saw follow

16
00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:41.990
another cannot appear.

17
00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:45.190
Here is one transformer block.

18
00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.760
Attention mixes, and the

19
00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:49.780
residual adds the original back.

20
00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:51.540
Quick check!

21
00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:53.680
Attention builds a new

22
00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:55.100
vector by doing what?

23
00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:58.370
A weighted sum of the other vectors.

24
00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:01.390
The scores become weights, and

25
00:01:01.390 --> 00:01:02.730
the weights do the mixing.

26
00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:06.580
In the app, open the eight-note lab.

27
00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:09.380
Read the tune, then the four

28
00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:11.740
notes it writes next, and name

29
00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:13.640
one pitch it cannot invent.

30
00:01:14.980 --> 00:01:15.740
Your turn.

31
00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:17.920
Did those eight notes

32
00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:20.100
compose a piece of music?

33
00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:22.240
Remember this.

34
00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:26.120
Attention mixes, the residual keeps the

35
00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:28.500
original, and the eight notes only

36
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:28.880
counted.

37
00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:30.920
Try it tonight.

38
00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:34.020
Write one sentence on what was

39
00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:35.820
counted, and what was not.
